    "title": "Deputies searching for man accused of shooting coworker in Volusia County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By FOX 35 Digital Staff ,\n4 hours ago PIERSON, Fla. - Deputies are searching for a man accused of shooting his coworker in Volusia County, authorities said. The sheriff’s office said 45-year-old Augustin Hernandez Gonzalez approached the victim’s car in Pierson on Sunday and shot him in the neck. The victim was hospitalized and is expected to recover. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
